<rss version="2.0"><channel><title>IndieHOT 独立游戏热点</title><link>https://staroltest.github.io/indie-game-hot/</link><description>IndieHOT 每天从一批独立游戏信源里收动态，按规则打分精选：引擎与工具、发行与宣发、开发日志、行业与融资、展会与活动、评测与复盘。只显示标题、一句自己写简介与原文链接，不转载全文。</description><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 01:35:15 GMT</lastBuildDate><item><title>用这套优化工具包让 Unreal Engine 5 项目保持干净</title><link>https://80.lv/articles/keep-unreal-engine-5-projects-clean-with-this-optimization-toolkit</link><description>Leartes Studios 的编辑器扩展能给项目健康度打分、找出闲置资产并梳理依赖关系，帮 UE5 开发者把项目里的杂物清出去。</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 13:11:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">3ce9d8e2ac71fd8d4ee2e710010b525e54322835</guid><source url="https://80.lv/articles/keep-unreal-engine-5-projects-clean-with-this-optimization-toolkit">80 Level</source></item><item><title>Unity CLI 1.0 正式发布！</title><link>https://unity.com/the-unity-cli-1.0-is-here</link><description>Unity 命令行工具走出测试版，开发者可把 Claude Code 等 AI 编程助手接进 Unity 项目，在终端里自动跑构建和测试。</description><pubDate>Tue, 17 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">c31d0d34a17ff92ab6443e4ceed4062fe025d009</guid><source url="https://unity.com/the-unity-cli-1.0-is-here">Unity 博客</source></item><item><title>用 UE5 还原《Bluey》标志性 2D 画风：Gameloft Brisbane 的开发访谈</title><link>https://www.unrealengine.com/developer-interviews/say-cheese-recreating-an-iconic-2d-art-style-with-ue5-in-blueys-happy-snaps</link><description>Gameloft Brisbane 团队分享如何用 Unreal Engine 5 的动画工具，把热门儿童动画《Bluey》的 2D 世界搬进 3D 游戏。</description><pubDate>Mon, 16 Nov 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">b5f0043cd5b8425b97593ce35c3a133329a61b70</guid><source url="https://www.unrealengine.com/developer-interviews/say-cheese-recreating-an-iconic-2d-art-style-with-ue5-in-blueys-happy-snaps">Unreal Engine 博客</source></item><item><title>《怪物猎人 Outlanders》两周内购收入突破 1020 万美元</title><link>https://www.gamesindustry.biz/monster-hunter-outlanders-passes-102-million-in-iap-revenue-in-two-weeks</link><description